ormalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":7526,"title":"","description":"0","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Action","Drama","Thriller"],"id":7526,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Aurangzeb","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk52/shows/1a87eb55-cd43-4dba-a9c6-34e3293cc256.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk42/shows/3e3fffb4-49f7-40f0-bff6-413f7aa76574.jpg","likes":6,"dislikes":0,"views":1942,"release_date":"1368748800000","length":8243,"description":"Gurgaon is the most modern boom-town of \"India Shining\", the new frontier to be conquered by those who understand real estate. This city rose from a small town to a boom town satellite city in just fifteen years. However the law and order is yet to catch up. A family of Policemen - A family of Gangsters - Under the guise of a respected citizen, Yashwardhan (Jackie Shroff) runs a parallel world - a world, where he is the Emperor. To bring down a criminal - the law will have to now think like a criminal. When Vishal (Arjun Kapoor) is planted in Yashwardhan's world in place of Ajay (Arjun Kapoor), the lawmakers (Rishi Kapoor and Prithviraj) roll the dice and a sequence of events unravel - something much more than what Vishal bargained for, as he finds himself in a predicament that puts him to the test. Aurangzeb is all about a world where Kingship knows no Kinship and where there can be only one Emperor.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.6}],"value":6.6,"age":"r"},"episode_id":7526,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}